@startuml iniciarSesion-diseño
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Iniciar Sesión

actor "Coordinador" as Coordinador
participant "Navegador\n(Thymeleaf)" as View
participant "IniciarSesionController\n(@Controller)" as Controller
participant "Spring Security\n(SecurityFilterChain)" as Security
participant "AutenticacionService\n(@Service)" as Service
participant "UsuarioRepository\n(JpaRepository)" as Repo
database "Base de Datos\n(H2)" as DB

== Mostrar formulario ==

Coordinador -> View: Navega a /login
activate View
View -> Controller: GET /login
activate Controller
Controller --> View: login.html
deactivate Controller
View --> Coordinador: Muestra formulario de login
deactivate View

== Autenticación ==

Coordinador -> View: Introduce usuario y contraseña
activate View
View -> Security: POST /login (username, password)
activate Security
Security -> Service: loadUserByUsername(username)
activate Service
Service -> Repo: findByUsername(username)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM usuarios WHERE username = ?
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Usuario
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Optional<Usuario>
deactivate Repo
Service --> Security: UserDetails
deactivate Service
Security -> Security: verificarContraseña(BCrypt)

alt credenciales correctas
    Security --> View: redirect: GET /panel
    View --> Coordinador: Panel principal
else credenciales incorrectas
    Security --> View: redirect: GET /login?error
    View --> Coordinador: Formulario con mensaje de error
end
deactivate Security
deactivate View

@enduml
